: "  shape:\n    stage: public\n    users: public\n    monetization: paywall\n    surfaces: [web, mobile]\n  nfr:\n    performance:   { level: high, gate: \"p95 page load under 2 s\" }"}}}, {"asked": "When is chargeback handling added?", "found": "When monetization is monetized — not this shop, yet.", "source": {"tier": "phoenix", "path": "knowledge/domains/payments.md", "start": 61, "end": 61, "fingerprint": "sha256:8f5db4d57d3989c01297b8c12704c197fca7ac990ba30111bde82d6068c8f436", "text": "  - Level 2 — chargeback handling: receive and process issuer-initiated reversals. Add when `shape.monetization: monetized`.", "version": "5fcd88e05cf6", "around": {"start": 58, "end": 64, "text": "- **Refunds & Disputes** — full/partial refunds; chargeback handling; dispute\n  evidence workflow when a regime or volume requires the audit trail.\n  - Level 1 — full / partial refunds: reverse a charge in whole or part via the PSP. The floor.\n  - Level 2 — chargeback handling: receive and process issuer-initiated reversals. Add when `shape.monetization: monetized`.\n  - Level 3 — dispute-evidence workflow: assemble and submit evidence with an audit trail. Add when `nfr.observability >= high`, or `compliance` includes PCI-DSS.\n- **Saved Methods / One-Click** — when repeat purchase or conversion speed matters;\n  tokenised vaulting only (mandatory under PCI-DSS)."}}}], "from_update": null}, {"citation_id": "cite-20261018-011", "issue": 613, "play": "/understand", "question": "How does a shopper get back into a locked account?", "answer": "Password reset, unlock, and timed self-service auto-unlock.", "decided_by": "product-os-keeper (/understand)", "decided_at": "2026-10-18T19:01:26Z", "trace": [{"asked": "What security level and compliance does the profile set?", "found": "Security is high; PCI-DSS and GDPR are in force.", "source": {"tier": "garura", "path": "product/product-os/profile.yaml", "start": 11, "end": 14, "fingerprint": "sha256:792104d6b9ddcfb5eb567bd3e3e3173bce8d6c5a3d